@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml

title L3：Spring Boot 自动装配类图（二期可靠发送）
left to right direction

package "Starter / Config\nmessage-starter" #F3E8FF {
  class MessageAutoConfiguration
  class MessageProperties
  class MessageRouteProperties
  class MessageSerializerProperties
  class MessageSendReliabilityProperties
  class MessageDemoProperties
}

package "Core\nmessage-core" #EDE7F6 {
  class MessageTemplate
  class MessageEnvelopeEnricher
  class MessageProviderRegistry
  class MessageWireCodec
  interface MessageIdGenerator
}

package "Core Send\nmessage-core.send" #FFF3E0 {
  interface MessageSendExecutor
  class DirectMessageSender
  class MessageSendReliabilityOptions
}

package "Reliable Send\nmessage-core.send.reliability" #FFF3E0 {
  class DefaultReliableMessageSender
}

package "Retry Component" #FCE4EC {
  class RetryExecutor
  class RetryPolicyRegistry
}

MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageProperties
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageRouteProperties
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageSerializerProperties
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageSendReliabilityProperties
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageDemoProperties
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageTemplate
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageEnvelopeEnricher
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageProviderRegistry
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageWireCodec
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageIdGenerator
MessageAutoConfiguration --> MessageSendExecutor
MessageSendExecutor <|.. DirectMessageSender
MessageSendExecutor <|.. DefaultReliableMessageSender
DefaultReliableMessageSender --> RetryExecutor
DefaultReliableMessageSender --> RetryPolicyRegistry
MessageSendReliabilityOptions --> MessageSendReliabilityProperties

note right of MessageAutoConfiguration
reliability.send.enabled=false：DirectMessageSender。
reliability.send.enabled=true：需要 RetryExecutor / RetryPolicyRegistry。
缺少 retry bean 时启动失败，不静默降级。
end note
@enduml
